  "description": "For expressions and reflection. Turn lambdas into text: \"myParam.MyList[i].MyProperty\". Extract structured method call data: { \"MyMethod\", Parameters = { \"myParameter\", int, 3 } }. Find types and implementations for plug-ins. Access private members with Accessors. Use ReflectionCache for fast access to properties, fields, methods and indexers. Includes helpers like IsIndexer, IsStatic and more!",
